            "sid": "NUM 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JUD.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yuda 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kora mwana Isa, mwana Koati, mwana Levi, pamo na Datani na Abiramu bamwana Eliabu na Oni mwana Peleti, abantu ba mu luko lwa bena Rubeni, batalama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo baimina Mose. Baima pamo ne ntungulushi imyanda ibili na makumi yasano (250) isha bena Israeli, ishaishibikwa ku lukuta, ishasontelwe ukulasangwa ku cilye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo balongana ibumba pali Mose na Aroni babakaanya abati, “Nomba mwacilamo! Ulukuta lonse lwamushilo, na onse uulimo, na Yawe ali pakati kabo. Nga cinshi ico muisansabalikila pebumba lya bantu bakwa Yawe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Mose aumfwile ifi, awa panshi ubukupeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo aeba Kora ne bumba lyonse ali nalyo ati, “Yawe mailo ulucelo akatulanga umuntu wakwe, kabili uwamushilo. Akalenga nokuti uyo muntu apalame mupepi na ena. Umuntu akasala eo akapalamika kuli ena ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe Kora ne bumba lya bantu bobe mukacite ifi. Mukabuule ififukilisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mailo ulucelo mukalapwilemo umulilo, mukabikemo ububani pa cinso cakwa Yawe. Umuntu uo Yawe akasala, eukaba uwamushilo. Imwe, mwe bena Levi namucilamo!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose kabili aebele Kora ati, “Nomba umfweni mwe bena Levi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe kanshi tamwasekelamo ico Lesa wakwa Israeli amupatula ku lukuta lwa bena Israeli, pakuti mupalame uko ali mukubomba umulimo wakwa Yawe mwi tenti lyakwe, kabili no kwiminina ku lukuta no kutumika pakati kabo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lesa alimupalamika uko ali, iwe pamo na bena Levi banobe. Nomba kabili mulefwaya mupokolole na bushimapepo bwine! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu ni Yawe eo mwalonganina pamo iwe ne bumba lyobe mukuilishanyapo. Bushe Aroni nani uo mufwile ukuilishanyapo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose aitile Datani na Abiramu, bamwana Eliabu. Lelo nabo bamwasuka abati, “Ifwe tatwaiseko iyoo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe tawasekelamo pakutufumya mu Egupto mu calo icifumfumukamo umukaka no buci, pakuti twise tufwile muno mu matololo? Kabili na nomba uleumya no bukalamba pali ifwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili tawatutwala mu calo icifumfumukamo umukaka no buci nangu ukutupeela ifishilano fya filime na mabala ya myangashi. Bushe ulefwaya ukufimba aba bantu pa menso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ukufimba aba bantu pa menso:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ba Baibele bamo batila, “ukutonkola amenso,” icipilibula ukuti ukubepa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ifwe tatwaiseko iyoo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe Mose afulwa nganshi, elyo aeba Yawe ati, “Wipokelela mutuulo wabo. Ine nshapokololapo nangufye ni punda ku muntu nelyo umo, kabili nshabifyapo muntu nelyo umo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose aebele Kora ati, “Iwe ne bumba lyobe lyonse, mukamonekela ku cinso cakwa Yawe mailo, iwe wine, ibumba lyobe elyo na Aroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cila umo umo akasende icifukilisho cakwe no kubikamo ububani, fyonse fikabe imyanda ibili na makumi yasano (250) no kuleta pa cinso cakwa Yawe. Iwe wine na Aroni mukailetele icifukilisho cila muntu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi bonse umo umo epakubuula icifukilisho cakwe, alapwilamo no mulilo, abikamo no bubani. Epakwiminina pa mwinshi we Tenti Lyakukumaninamo na Mose pamo na Aroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Kora alongana no lukuta lonse mukukaanya Mose na Aroni pa mwinshi we Tenti Lyakukumaninamo, ubucindami bwakwa Yawe bwamonekela ulukuta lonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aebele Mose na Aroni ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Talukeni ku lukuta ulu, pakuti mbalofye nombaline.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Mose na Aroni bena epakuwa ubukupeme balapapata abati, “We Lesa, Lesa wa mipashi ya bantu bonse, bushe kuti wafulilwa ulukuta lwa bantu bonse, umo nga ewabifya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Yawe aeba Mose ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eba ulukuta lutaluke ku matenti yakwa Kora, Datani na Abiramu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose aimine aya kuli Datani na Abiramu, ne ntungulushi sha bena Israeli shamukonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo asoka ulukuta ati, “Talukeni ku matenti ya aba bantu ababi! Kabili mwikumya na ku cipe cabo nelyo cimo. Epali mwaisa sendelwa pamo pa mulandu wa bubi bwabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe ibumba epakutaluka ku matenti yakwa Kora, Datani na Abiramu. Datani na Abiramu epakufumina panse baiminina pa mwinshi wa matenti yabo, pamo na bakashi na bana babo no twaice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose atila, “Muli ici emo mwalaishibila ukuti Yawe ewantuma kukubomba ifintu fyonse ifi, kabili mwishibe ukuti te ku mano yandi mombela iyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti aba bantu bafwafye imfwa Lesa, ngefyo abantu bonse bafwa, awe ninshi Yawe tewantuma nakalya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo nga cakuti Yawe acita icintu cimo icipya icishatala acicitikapo, no mushili walepuka no kubamina pamo pene ne fintu fyabo fyonse, kabili baya abomi ku calo ca bafwa, ninshi muli nokwishiba ukuti aba bantu nabasuula Yawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo apwile ukusosa fyonse ifi, umushili apo baiminine walepuka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabili wacenama no kubamina pamo pene ne ndupwa shabo, bonse abantu bakwa Kora ne fipe fyonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baile abomi ku calo ca bafwa, pamo pene ne fipe fyabo fyonse. Umushili wabelikisha, baloba no kufuma pebumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Israeli pakumfwa inkuuta shabo, bonse abali mumbali, bafulumuka no kupunda balepunda abati, “Naifwe bene umushili kuti watumina!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili umulilo wafumine kuli Yawe no koca abaume imyanda ibili na makumi yasano (250) abaletuula ububani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yawe aebele Mose ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eba Eleasa mwana Aroni shimapepo ukuti afumye ififukilisho mu mito ya bantu abapile, apose imifito ukutali, pantu ififukilisho fyamushilo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ififukilisho fya bantu abafwilile pa bubifi bwabo. Kanshi ufule ififukilisho ku nondo fipapatale ngo tumalata, mufimbe pa bulambo pantu fyacituulwa pa cinso cakwa Yawe kanshi fyamushilo. Ici cibe e cishibilo ca bena Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi shimapepo Eleasa epakubuula filya fifukilisho fyaletele abantu abapile, bafulamo utumalata, bafimba na pa bulambo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngefyo Yawe amukonkomeshe ukupitila muli Mose. Kanshi ici cakwibukishako abena Israeli ukuti uushili shimapepo, kabili uushili uwa mu lupwa lwakwa Aroni, tali nakupalama no kocela Yawe ububani, epali afwa nga filya fyafwile Kora na bantu bakwe bonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubushiku bwakonkelepo, ulukuta lonse ulwa bena Israeli lwailishenye kuli Mose na Aroni aluti, “Abantu bakwa Yawe nimwe mwabepeye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba ilyo ulukuta lwalongana mukukaanya Mose na Aroni, bena bapilibukila kwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo, apopenefye bamona ikumbi lyakupapo no bucindami bwakwa Yawe bwamoneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose na Aroni baya kuntanshi ye Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Yawe aeba Mose ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Talukeni kuli ulu lukuta, pakuti mbalofye nombaline!” Kabili Mose na Aroni bawa panshi ubukupeme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose aebele Aroni ati, “Buula icifukilisho cobe, ulapwilemo no mulilo wa pa bulambo, ubikemo no bubani. Endesha, uye ne cifukilisho ku lukuta, kabafutileko pa fya bubifi bwabo! Yawe nafulwa nganshi ne cikuko nacitendeka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Aroni nao acita nefyo Mose amwebele, abutukila mukati ke bumba lya bantu ninshi icikuko nacitendeka kale mu bantu. Lelo Aroni apekenye icifukilisho no bubanimo, abafutilako pa bubifi bwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili aiminine pakati ka bantu abashele abomi elyo na bafwile, ne cikuko ilyo linefye capwa no kupwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba abantu bafwile ku cikuko bali amakana ikumi limo na yane ne myanda cine lubali (14,700), ukulunda ku mpendwa ya bafwile pa mulandu wa kutalama kwakwa Kora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Aroni abwelela kuli Mose pa mwinshi we Tenti Lyakukumaninamo, pantu icikuko calipwile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
